### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health


### ─── Auth ────────────────────────────────────────────


### Register Owner
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@test.com",
  "password": "Secret123",
  "displayName": "Game Shop",
  "role": "owner"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@test.com",
  "password": "Secret123"
}

### Refresh Token (paste your token below)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<paste_refresh_token_here>"
}


### ─── Stores ────────────────────────────────────────────


### Get all stores (public)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stores

### Get my stores (owner)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stores/mine
Authorization: Bearer <paste_access_token_here>

### Create a store (owner)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/stores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <paste_access_token_here>

{
  "name": "Pixel Vault",
  "description": "Retro games and consoles",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "city": "Portland",
  "state": "OR",
  "zipCode": "97201",
  "phone": "503-555-0100",
  "website": "https://pixelvault.example.com"
}

### Get store by ID (public)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stores/<paste_store_id_here>

### Update a store (owner)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/stores/<paste_store_id_here>
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <paste_access_token_here>

{
  "description": "Updated description — best retro shop in town!"
}

### Delete a store (owner)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/stores/<paste_store_id_here>
Authorization: Bearer <paste_access_token_here>


### ─── Items ──────────────────────────────────────────────


### Get all items for a store (public)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stores/<paste_store_id_here>/items

### Get single item (public)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stores/items/<paste_item_id_here>

### Create an item (owner)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/stores/<paste_store_id_here>/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <paste_access_token_here>

{
  "title": "Super Mario World",
  "description": "Complete in box, manual included",
  "platform": "SNES",
  "category": "game",
  "condition": "cib",
  "price": 49.99,
  "imageUrls": [],
  "isPromoted": false
}

### Update an item (owner) — mark as sold
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/stores/items/<paste_item_id_here>
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <paste_access_token_here>

{
  "isSold": true
}

### Delete an item (owner)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/stores/items/<paste_item_id_here>
Authorization: Bearer <paste_access_token_here>


### ─── Search ─────────────────────────────────────────────


### Search all available items
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search

### Search by text query
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?query=mario

### Filter by platform
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?platform=SNES

### Filter by platform + condition
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?platform=SNES&condition=cib

### Price range filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?minPrice=10&maxPrice=50

### Full search — text + filters + pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?query=mario&platform=SNES&condition=cib&minPrice=10&maxPrice=100&page=1&limit=20

### Search within a specific store
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?storeId=<paste_store_id_here>&query=zelda
